## Repository Layout

```text
.
├── src/gym_anything/          core runtime library
├── benchmarks/environments/   benchmark environments and tasks
├── benchmarks/archive/        archived benchmark variants
├── benchmarks/splits/         train/test split definitions
├── benchmarks/registry/       split loaders and registry helpers
├── examples/tutorials/        lightweight tutorial environments
├── baselines/agents/          reference agents
├── baselines/evaluation/      single-run and batch harnesses
├── services/                  remote execution services
├── scripts/maintenance/       repo audit and maintenance scripts
├── tools/                     offline utilities
├── docs/                      reference documentation
└── research/                  experimental and archived code
```

See [docs/repository-structure.md](docs/repository-structure.md) for placement rules.
